      "id": "c039ad80-e326-443c-b559-38914f1012b9",
      "name": "Records",
      "description": {
        "content": "**Records** are created in the OpenGov Permitting & Licensing Employee Portal and/or Citizen Portal.\n\nA **Record** can have a **Form**, a **Workflow**, one or more public **Contacts** (the applicant and any guests), and one or more **Locations**.\n\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
